  "bio": "Denys Melo is a highly experienced tattoo artist who has been perfecting the traditional style of tattooing since 2004. Working out of Rio de Janeiro, Denys takes pride in offering a professional service to all clients, ensuring that every session is conducted with the utmost attention to detail and care. For a personalized quote or to book an appointment, clients are encouraged to reach out via direct message and can expect to be attended to at Daniel Novaes Tattoo by appointment.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTatuador e pintor de diferentes mídias. Atendo nos estúdios                                @danielnovaistattoo @satoritattoorio_",
